			"notes": "- Ore Gen is a thing! Only right now Sollogium has a texture, if you see a missing ore texture, thats probably one of the 5 metals currently available!\n- Sollogium Armor provides complete fire immunity (This is jank as I've only added it via the same method used for the Lava Charm in Treasure Expansion, this is by no means the final product of the feature.)\n- Framium Armor and Tools have no textures, however the Pickaxe has Fortune and as does Eilifligronium Tools! Same with Weapons! (For some reason I cant figure out Framium now does fire damage when it shouldnt so this feature will be worked on)\n- Now Compatible with Signal Industries (Fortune works on all of ores featured in Signal Industries, and eventually I will add dust of each metal that can be used in the machines to double the output! And I might just use the Alloy Smelter in this mod to create Eilifligronium)\n- There is an easter egg to get more steel from iron! Find out how to do it! :Peepo_Wink: \n\nThere is still crafting recipes for all ores involved just in case you're using a skyblock or world type that cant generate the ores!"
		},
